 "name": "Charonus",
 "sections": [
  {
   "body_text": "Charonus truly tests his prey to learn their limits. He attacks players using [Unstable Singularity] and creates [Gravitic Orbs] to hunt them down.",
   "id": 32982,
   "sections": [
    {
     "body_text": "$bullet;[Unstable Singularity] inflicts Shadow damage and reduces the movement speed of players caught within it.\r\n\r\n$bullet;[Gravitic Orbs] continually seek out players until collapsed by an [Unstable Singularity].",
     "id": 32983,
     "title": "Damage Dealers"
    },
    {
     "body_text": "$bullet;[Condensed Mass] inflicts high damage to all players.\r\n\r\n$bullet;[Gravitic Orbs] continually seek out players until collapsed by an [Unstable Singularity].",
     "id": 32984,
